     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 2.45,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "今晚，我这样。",
     "kind": "note",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "愿意打招呼，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "还是\n安静参与？",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.85,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "自己选。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 1.8,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "看看谁也在。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 3.9,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "示例角色 · 自动回复",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "放一张你的照片。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "21:48",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 1,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "拍摄时间，\n照片自己记得。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 10,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 2.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "示例照片 · 拍摄时间为虚构",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 11,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 2.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "拍的是哪一面？",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "人海。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "AI 在本机判断，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "照片不上传。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "没把握的时候，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "它就说不确定。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "你来选。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "保存，上墙。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "上墙啦！",
     "kind": "note",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 0.95,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "按拍摄时间，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "3 分钟以内，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "就是同一刻。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "规则判断，不是 AI。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "看这里！",
     "kind": "note",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 1.85,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "你拍人海，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 3.9,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "TA 拍舞台。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 2.9,
