     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "随时可以撤销。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "然后呢？",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 1.85,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "先招招手，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "对方愿意，\n才成朋友。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "私聊，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "从返场那首聊起。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "想安静的人，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "不会被打扰。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "散场以后，\n继续聊。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "今晚的\n专辑世界杯，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "原创虚构专辑",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.95,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "选一张，一起聊。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "2票",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 0.95,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "默契局：",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "揭晓前，谁也看不到。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 2.9,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "选到一起了！",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 1.9,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "长期社群，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "也留一个位置。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "再见，\n在下一场。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "创作角：",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "对方点头，才开始。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 2.05,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "把这一晚，\n留在手里。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "纪念卡，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "在你的浏览器里生成。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 9,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 2.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "散场后，\n仍有地方回来。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 9,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 2.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "每一场演出，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "散场",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 7.3,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "都可以多一层。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 6,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 1.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "设想",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 3.85,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "QQ音乐、酷狗",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 2.0,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "听完现场，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 2.9,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "顺手换一面。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 5,
     "on_s": 1.95,
     "need_s": 1.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "隐私",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 3.75,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "AI 在本机 · 你决定给谁看",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 10,
     "on_s": 3.8,
     "need_s": 2.5,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "同意",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 3.25,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "双方同意，才交换",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 7,
     "on_s": 3.3,
     "need_s": 1.75,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "好玩",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 2.8,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "世界杯 · 默契局 · 创作角",
     "kind": "label",
     "units": 9,
     "on_s": 2.8,
     "need_s": 2.25,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "曲终，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 2,
     "on_s": 3.9,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "人不散。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 3,
     "on_s": 2.9,
     "need_s": 0.8,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "打开链接，",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 4,
     "on_s": 3.0,
     "need_s": 1.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
     "text": "一人\n就能走完全程。",
     "kind": "title",
     "units": 8,
     "on_s": 2.85,
     "need_s": 2.0,
     "ok": true
    },
    {
